  "scope": "Finite Gaussian transcription of the fixed-regulator homogeneous Schrodinger evolution. Lean separately proves closure of weak solutions under complex linear combinations, uniqueness in the stated weak-solution class, dense extension to all physical L2 data, unitarity, composition, backward evolution, joint strong continuity, and the integrated equation for form-domain data. Full cutoff-family convergence, classical differentiation on the operator domain, the full six-mode infinite model, regulator removal, continuum limits, physical identification and the TOE are not established by this audit."
